#: ../../tools/harmonizome_tools.rst:95 72a9bf99857d42d1b6c3bf40115bc4d7
msgid "**Name**: ``Harmonizome_list_datasets``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/harmonizome_tools.rst:97 8f7ab14205424a74b9f50c185c61d17e
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all 100+ integrated genomics datasets available in "
"Harmonizome (Ma'ayan Lab). Returns dataset names that can be used to "
"explore gene-gene set associations. Covers gene expression (Allen Brain "
"Atlas, GTEx, BioGPS, CCLE, TCGA), pathways (BioCarta, KEGG, Reactome, "
"WikiPathways), protein interactions (BioGRID, PPI Hub), gene regulation "
"(ChEA, ENCODE, JASPAR), drug targets (DrugBank, CTD), disease "
"associations (OMIM, ClinVar, GAD, GWAS), phenotypes (MGI, HPO), and more."
msgstr ""

