#: ../../tools/harmonizome_tools.rst:126 ca2c0c4522f64287be1a83abf7cedeec
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search Harmonizome across genes, datasets, or attributes"
" by keyword. For gene search, returns matching gene symbols with names "
"and NCBI IDs via exact lookup and suggest API. For dataset search, "
"filters the 100+ dataset catalog by keyword. For attribute search, "
"returns auto-complete suggestions. Use entity\\_type to control what is "
"searched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/harmonizome_tools.rst:130 c77a4f6a3d9b4bcf91427b570b575d41
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search query. Examples: 'TP53', 'BRCA1', "
"'kinase', 'expression', 'pathway'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/harmonizome_tools.rst:133 9461ace5051b4b8bb9882b51b81cf230
msgid ""
"``entity_type`` (string) (optional) What to search for: 'gene' (default),"
" 'dataset', or 'attribute'."
msgstr ""

