#: ../../tools/harmonizome_tools.rst:163 1420fecdaf9b46baa870b5f5198bdda3
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for genes by keyword in Harmonizome (Ma'ayan "
"Lab). Returns matching gene symbols that can be used with "
"Harmonizome\\_get\\_gene for detailed information. Note: Harmonizome API "
"does not support server-side text filtering; this endpoint returns a "
"paginated list from the gene catalog. Use Harmonizome\\_search with "
"entity\\_type='gene' for keyword-based gene search."
